{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/663bc777622a08d28b8aede60c8abd29.avif?t=1768919396\" width=1125 height=150 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/5b816f06f71dde21e75fe0baa527b827.poster.avif?t=1768919396\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/5b816f06f71dde21e75fe0baa527b827.webm?t=1768919396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/5b816f06f71dde21e75fe0baa527b827.mp4?t=1768919396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immerse yourself in a harsh Russian city \u2014 a depressed neighborhood with an oppressive atmosphere, where life unfolds among alcoholics and poverty.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/25dc3f294284ae84f7b64de6ec5ff5fb.avif?t=1768919396\" width=1125 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/9bac26fba1c67c973f4d0343d6b6fbfe.poster.avif?t=1768919396\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/9bac26fba1c67c973f4d0343d6b6fbfe.webm?t=1768919396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/9bac26fba1c67c973f4d0343d6b6fbfe.mp4?t=1768919396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The main heroine lives in difficult conditions, desperately seeking a way out of poverty and her toxic surroundings. She decides to take a job at the mysterious night caf\u00e9, <strong>Red Moon Cafe</strong>. There, she must prepare coffee, maintain order, and serve unpredictable customers whose behavior pushes her fragile psyche to the edge. Over time, she begins to realize that the caf\u00e9\u2019s owner may not be who he appears to be.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/52ad07f5841c6ae7e052c0a16a3e3723.avif?t=1768919396\" width=1125 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/3a956dd3635c178244eee15cefbee50a.poster.avif?t=1768919396\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/3a956dd3635c178244eee15cefbee50a.webm?t=1768919396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/3a956dd3635c178244eee15cefbee50a.mp4?t=1768919396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Realistic Simulation:</strong> Experience the daily grind of coffee preparation and demanding night shifts.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unique Setting:</strong> An authentically recreated rough neighborhood in Russia, complete with its gritty atmosphere and inhabitants.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Realism:</strong> Featuring one of the most detailed well-being and physical state systems.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survival Elements:</strong> Manage hunger, health, self-defense, and a tight personal economy.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Psychological Horror Elements:</strong> Experience hallucinations, anxiety, and the protagonist\u2019s mental instability.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Evolving Narrative:</strong> A story-driven experience with unpredictable characters and a compelling finale.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/6982e4979c2c7db82a4c68f418dad270.avif?t=1768919396\" width=1125 height=150 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/8f05189aa359533d7b77409cec0aeff0.poster.avif?t=1768919396\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/8f05189aa359533d7b77409cec0aeff0.webm?t=1768919396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/8f05189aa359533d7b77409cec0aeff0.mp4?t=1768919396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Barista Work:</strong> Prepare coffee using specific recipes, serve pastries, and keep the cafe tidy every night. Every action requires focus and precision.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Economy and Resources:</strong> Spend your hard-earned wages on food, mental health medication, and self-defense tools. Strategic resource management helps the protagonist stay fit and work efficiently.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Consequences:</strong> A lack of food and water depletes stamina and well-being. Mental instability makes brewing coffee and serving customers much harder, while a lack of protection leaves you vulnerable in a dangerous neighborhood.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fragile Realism:</strong> Monitor the protagonist\u2019s stamina and basic needs, including hunger and bathroom breaks. Remember her vulnerability\u2014extreme exhaustion or physical trauma will lead to a loss of consciousness.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Strategy:</strong> Choose which customers to prioritize, where to cut corners on ingredients, and when to avoid risks. Every choice impacts your income, reputation, and life outside the cafe, making every shift tense and realistic.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/feb08eceaab0dcf9d21da48072abb79a.poster.avif?t=1768919396\" width=1170 height=584 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/feb08eceaab0dcf9d21da48072abb79a.webm?t=1768919396\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/extras/feb08eceaab0dcf9d21da48072abb79a.mp4?t=1768919396\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4055030?t=1768919396","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4055030?t=1768919396","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/75177d3ce8bb31f0b15656aa2a2151d728021350/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768919396","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4055030/75177d3ce8bb31f0b15656aa2a2151d728021350/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768919396","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Ste